The '''Duel Stages''' are a group of [[Timed Score Reward|timed stages]] appearing during certain special events. The first four were added in [[Version 8.9 Update|Version 8.9]], the fifth was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]] and the sixth was added in [[Version 10.4 Update|Version 10.4]]. [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]] introduced the [[Duel Stages Challenge]], which combines all Duel Stages into a single map.

==List of Levels==
There are three stages per map, each with a Cat Deploy Limit and enemy limit of 1. Taking over 15 minutes to beat any one stage will cause an [[Assassin Bear]] to spawn.

